{"id":409,"date":"2026-08-14T06:24:31","date_gmt":"2026-08-14T06:24:31","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=409"},"modified":"2026-08-14T07:14:41","modified_gmt":"2026-08-14T07:14:41","slug":"page-setup-dimensions","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/page-management\/page-setup-dimensions\/","title":{"rendered":"Page Setup &#038; Dimensions"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Page Setup &amp; Dimensions<\/span><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">Configuring your canvas correctly is the foundational step for any publication. Open Publisher provides robust controls for document sizing, margins, and orientation directly from the <strong>Page Design<\/strong> ribbon tab.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Page Size &amp; Format<\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">The <strong>Page Design<\/strong> ribbon tab houses the Size dropdown, which lets you instantly resize the entire canvas to standard international and regional formats:<\/p>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\">\n<tbody>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td bgcolor=\"#007670\" width=\"30%\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><b>Format<\/b><\/span><\/span><\/td>\n<td bgcolor=\"#007670\" width=\"70%\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><b>Dimensions<\/b><\/span><\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td><span style=\"font-size: small;\">A3<\/span><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: small;\">297 x 420 mm<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td><span style=\"font-size: small;\">A4<\/span><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: small;\">210 x 297 mm (European\/UK default)<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td><span style=\"font-size: small;\">A5<\/span><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: small;\">148 x 210 mm<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Letter<\/span><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: small;\">8.5 x 11 in (US\/Canada\/Mexico default)<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Legal<\/span><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: small;\">8.5 x 14 in<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Tabloid<\/span><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: small;\">11 x 17 in<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Business Card<\/span><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: small;\">3.5 x 2 in<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<p class=\"western\"><strong>Locale-Aware Defaults:<\/strong> When you create a new document, Open Publisher automatically selects the correct default size for your region. Users in the US, Canada, Mexico, Colombia, Venezuela, Chile, and the Philippines default to US Letter. Users everywhere else default to A4.<\/p>\n<p class=\"western\">Each preset is represented by a unique icon in the dropdown, and the top-right corner of the canvas always displays the correct format indicator, which updates instantly whenever you change size.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-413 aligncenter\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot_2026-08-14_072624.png_202608140727.jpeg\" alt=\"page Sizes\" width=\"946\" height=\"177\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot_2026-08-14_072624.png_202608140727.jpeg 2393w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot_2026-08-14_072624.png_202608140727-300x56.jpeg 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot_2026-08-14_072624.png_202608140727-1024x192.jpeg 1024w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot_2026-08-14_072624.png_202608140727-768x144.jpeg 768w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot_2026-08-14_072624.png_202608140727-1536x288.jpeg 1536w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot_2026-08-14_072624.png_202608140727-2048x383.jpeg 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 946px) 100vw, 946px\" \/><\/h3>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Page Orientation<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-416 alignright\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-14-073015.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"257\" height=\"355\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-14-073015.png 474w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-14-073015-217x300.png 217w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 257px) 100vw, 257px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">You can toggle between Portrait and Landscape directly from the Page Design tab. The print and PDF export engines handle mixed-orientation documents correctly, automatically rotating pages in the output to match what you designed.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Page Margins<\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">The Margins button in the Page Design ribbon controls the safe-zone guides on the canvas. Clicking it opens a dropdown with five instant presets:<\/p>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\">\n<tbody>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td bgcolor=\"#007670\" width=\"30%\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><b>Preset<\/b><\/span><\/span><\/td>\n<td bgcolor=\"#007670\" width=\"70%\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><b>Margin Values<\/b><\/span><\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Normal<\/span><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: small;\">0.5 in on all sides<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Narrow<\/span><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: small;\">0.25 in on all sides<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Moderate<\/span><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: small;\">1 in top\/bottom, 0.75 in left\/right<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Wide<\/span><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: small;\">1 in on all sides<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Zero<\/span><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: small;\">0 in \u2014 for borderless, full-bleed printing<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<p class=\"western\">Each preset shows a small dynamic page icon that visually represents the margin layout before you click.<\/p>\n<p class=\"western\"><strong>Custom Margins:<\/strong> For precise control, click <em>Custom Margins&#8230;<\/em> to open a configuration modal where you can set independent top, bottom, left, and right margins down to the pixel. Your custom margins integrate immediately with the blue snap guides visible on the canvas and are saved into your .opub file so they persist when the file is reopened. Margins are automatically excluded from exported images and PDFs, meaning they never appear in your final output.<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-418 aligncenter\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/DropdownsAndMargins.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"799\" height=\"488\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/DropdownsAndMargins.webp 1139w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/DropdownsAndMargins-300x183.webp 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/DropdownsAndMargins-1024x626.webp 1024w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/DropdownsAndMargins-768x469.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 799px) 100vw, 799px\" \/><\/p>\n<p><!-- PLACEHOLDER FOR NANO BANANA \/ PDF SCREENSHOT: MARGINS --><\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Page Setup &amp; Dimensions Configuring your canvas correctly is the foundational step for any publication. Open Publisher provides robust controls for document sizing, margins, and orientation directly from the Page Design ribbon tab. Page Size &amp; Format The Page Design ribbon tab houses the Size dropdown, which lets you instantly resize the entire canvas to [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":420,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[9],"class_list":["post-409","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-page-management"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/409","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/knowledgebase"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=409"}],"version-history":[{"count":6,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/409\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":422,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/409\/revisions\/422"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/420"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=409"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"knowledgebase_cat","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase_cat?post=409"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}